{"id":"6c166bd3b5abb270","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Full Functor","display":"df-zfc-cat2-full-functor — ZFC Cat2 Full Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-full-functor — ZFC Cat2 Full Functor","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-full-functor — ZFC Cat2 Full Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D \\in V\">\\(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}full\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,\nD_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in C_0\\;\\forall u\\in D_1\\;\n\\bigl(s_D(u)=F_0(A)\\land t_D(u)=F_0(B)\n\\to\\exists f\\in C_1\\;\n(s_C(f)=A\\land t_C(f)=B\\land F_1(f)=u)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}full\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,\nD_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in C_0\\;\\forall u\\in D_1\\;\n\\bigl(s_D(u)=F_0(A)\\land t_D(u)=F_0(B)\n\\to\\exists f\\in C_1\\;\n(s_C(f)=A\\land t_C(f)=B\\land F_1(f)=u)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fullness is surjectivity of every induced hom-set map, expanded here without an untyped <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Surj}\">\\(\\operatorname{Surj}\\)</span> abbreviation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}full\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,\nD_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in C_0\\;\\forall u\\in D_1\\;\n\\bigl(s_D(u)=F_0(A)\\land t_D(u)=F_0(B)\n\\to\\exists f\\in C_1\\;\n(s_C(f)=A\\land t_C(f)=B\\land F_1(f)=u)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Surj}","display":false}],"bytes":1222,"backlinks":[{"id":"6477de4a04201a72","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S$ (full-functor predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1580","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f"]}